OL,3,ARoyals roll out red carpet for visiting
OL,4,ASultan
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe King and Queen, along with the
OL,7,FPrince and Princess of Wales, were part
OL,8,Fof a colourful ceremonial welcome for
OL,9,Fthe Sultan of Oman as his state visit
OL,10,Fto the UK begins.
OL,12,FThe red carpet was rolled out in
OL,13,FWindsor for the ruler of Oman, which is
OL,14,Fan important strategic partner in the
OL,15,FMiddle East against the backdrop of the
OL,16,Fconflict with Iran.
OL,18,FIt has been seen as a diplomatic bridge
OL,19,Fbetween the West and Iran and Sultan
OL,20,FHaitham bin Tarik Al Said will be given
OL,21,Fthe full soft power treatment from his
OL,22,Froyal hosts.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
